   * constraints (such as completion date or description requirements) are
   * enforced.
   *
   * This endpoint is secured; only the owner of the target todo item may access
   * it. Operations on system-generated or audit fields are forbidden. On
   * success, the API returns the complete updated todo item entity. Edge cases,
