   * the todo_list_todos table.
   *
   * This operation allows an authenticated user to delete (hard remove) a todo
   * item that they own. It verifies ownership and ensures only the correct item
   * is removed. All system integrity and authorization checks are strictly
   * enforced.
   *
   * There is no soft deletion logic and no request body. Deletion of items not
   * present or not owned by the user triggers meaningful error feedback. No
   * representation of the deleted item is returned.
   *
   * @param connection
   * @param todoId Unique identifier of the target todo item record in the
   *   todo_list_todos table.
